{"version":1,"content":"<p>瑞典皇家科學院周一（12日）公布，2026年諾貝爾經濟學獎由兩名美國學者共享，分別是史丹福大學的Robert Hall及哥倫比亞大學的Michael Woodford，以表揚其對「宏觀經濟穩定的微觀經濟基礎」的研究的貢獻。</p><p>（諾貝爾獎網站)</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T10:19:35.371464+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T09:52:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T03:37:54.449072+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T10:17:40.946937+00:00","content_hash":"1e68eb3f4ff2cfeb8647ce3bfcca9a337aadd4abd431a7ff6dd50b082cc9ccd4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}